I created archives from onelist and egroups contents.
First I did download all the available messages. Then
I extracted useful information out from them (mainly
available message headers, and body).

Then I spent some time trying to invent good way to
associate messages discussing same topic under one
category. In the end I did strip my original ideas a
little and current threading model just groups
messages instead of making tree out of them.

So feel free to surf back in time:

http://www.topcities.com/Arts/bugathlon/lojban.html

